  "prefLabel": "Ed 1122.04 Appointment of a Hearing Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1122.04 Appointment of a Hearing Officer. If an alternative dispute resolution option is utilized by the parties and resolution is not achieved, the individual selected as a neutral or mediator shall not be the same individual who is subsequently appointed as a hearing officer to preside at an administrative due process hearing in the same matter pursuant to Ed 1123.24.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
